# NOTE — this file is intentionally a placeholder.
#
# `eas build --local` in monorepo mode reads `.easignore` from the
# **monorepo root** (next to `pnpm-workspace.yaml`), NOT from the
# workspace package. A previous draft of this file tried to keep
# `apps/client/dist/` out of `.gitignore` exclusion here, but EAS
# never consulted it — the prod APK kept shipping without the LAN
# bundle. See `<repo-root>/.easignore` for the file that's actually
# in effect.
